| File | Prior direct calls | Reason |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `integrations/infrastructure/prisma-integration-delivery.repository.ts` | 2 | `BG_INTEGRATION_DELIVERY` |

`claimPendingGlobal` / `claimPendingForTenant` previously used **dynamic**
`import("../../db/prisma")` then `getPrismaAdmin()`. Both switch to a static
`getBackgroundAdminClient(BACKGROUND_ADMIN_REASON.BG_INTEGRATION_DELIVERY)`.

Tenant-scoped enqueue/mark paths already use `withTenantRls` — unchanged.

